  "text": "Electrochemotherapy | Cancer Care for Pets | BluePearl\nSkip to the content\nJoin the BluePearl Family!\nWe're hiring.\nFind a Hospital\nSearch the site\nSearch\nSearch the site\nSearch\nResources for Pet Owners\nWhy BluePearl\nIntake Form\nPay with CareCredit\nPet Care Articles and Videos\nStories from the Heart\nResources for Veterinarians\nWhy Refer to BluePearl\nReferral Portal & Medical Records\nOrder BluePearl Materials\nMedical Library for DVMs\nAbout Us\nWho We Are\nOur Areas of Expertise\nNewsroom\nContact Us\nCareers\nFind a Hospital\nHome\nHospitals\nBluePearl Pet Hospital Auburn Hills, MI\nElectrochemotherapy\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\nAuburn Hills, MI\nElectrochemotherapy\n248.371.3713\n3412 E Walton Blvd.\nAuburn Hills, MI 48326\n[email protected]\nRequest Appointment\nOverview\nServices\nOur vets\nReferring vets\nRequest Appointment\nOverview\nServices\nOur vets\nReferring vets\nRequest Appointment\nElectrochemotherapy (ECT) for pets.\nElectrochemotherapy is an advanced treatment used to treat certain tumors in pets. It combines chemotherapy with electrical pulses that help the medication attack the tumor more effectively, while minimizing impact to healthy tissues.\nECT may be recommended for pets with:\nTumors on or just beneath the skin\nTumors that could not be completely removed during surgery\nSurgical areas where cancer cells remain after tumor removal\nMost treatments are usually performed under sedation and have few side effects.\nAvailable Mondays through Thursdays.\nRequest an appointment.\nCall us\nRequest appointment\nGet In Touch\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\n2950 Busch Lake Blvd.\nTampa\n, FL\n33614\nContact Us\nFind a Hospital Near Me\nCareers at BluePearl\nBluePearl™ Cares\nWeb Accessibility\nYour Privacy Choices\nStay Connected\nHere for pets.\nWhen it matters most.\nStay connected with BluePearl for expert advice, helpful tips and trusted information to support you and your pet - delivered straight to your inbox.\nSign Up\ncookies notice\nprivacy policy\nlegal\nad choices\nterms & conditions\naccessibility\ncontact us\na\nbrand\n© 2026 BluePearl Holdings LLC. All rights reserved.\nCookie Settings",
